+**Router:** `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design <TICKET>` — runs all ten phases in one session, stopping once per phase (sign-off, then commit) for confirmation. Bail out at any point and resume with the individual command. One skill (`design`) owns all ten phases; Review, Address Feedback, Publish, and Completion stay independently invocable and resumable the same way they always did: `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design review-gate` opens the draft MR and the session pauses; `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design address-feedback` is the next invocation — it confirms the outcome and, only if the approver raised concerns, loops back to an earlier phase, re-approves, or declines; `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design publish` runs once the gate is approved; `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design complete` runs alone for a design whose docs landed (or that was declined) but was never archived.
 
