 ## What lives where
 
-| Content                        | Lives in                                                                       |
-| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
-| Options, trade-offs, rationale | `Stories/<TICKET>/design/` — never graduates                                   |
-| WAF assessment                 | `design/Report.md` WAF section — never graduates                               |
-| Chosen approach (outcome only) | `Stories/<TICKET>/solution/` → drives `{{DESIGN_DOCS_ROOT}}` update at Publish |
-| Implementation spec            | `Stories/<TICKET>/solution/` → guides Dev tickets                              |
+| Content                        | Lives in                                                                                                 |
+| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| Options, trade-offs, rationale | `{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}<TICKET>/design/` — never graduates                                              |
+| WAF assessment                 | `design/Report.md` WAF section — never graduates                                                         |
+| Chosen approach (outcome only) | `{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}<TICKET>/solution/` → drives `{{DESIGN_DOCS_ROOT}}` update at Publish            |
+| Implementation spec            | `{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}<TICKET>/solution/` → guides Dev tickets, published to the tracker at Completion |
+
+Active designs live at `{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}[{TICKET}] {name}/`; archived designs move to
+`{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}approved/[{TICKET}] {name}/` (the normal outcome) or
+`{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}declined/[{TICKET}] {name}/` (rejected at Address Feedback).
+`{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}` is `Stories/design/` for a Project design or
+`Stories/product-design/` for a Product design — either way separate from the
+dev skill's own `Stories/[{TICKET}] {name}/impl/`.
 
